1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
the word Kreupasanam echoed loudly. So I went out and asked people where this Kreupasanam was.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:14,000
They showed me the way, through Thuravoor. I came along that path, reached here through Thuravoor, and as I looked around,

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:20,000
although there wasn't this much crowd back then, and this building wasn't this big, there was a small room.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:29,000
The Eucharistic Adoration was taking place in that small room. There were several people standing in a line. As they stood in line,

5
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:35,000
I saw Father for the very first time. Father was standing there, blessing everyone just like this.

6
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:41,000
So what did I do? Seeing the line, I went into that room, not even knowing it was Eucharistic Adoration.

7
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:48,000
I saw everyone kneeling there, so I too went and knelt down. As I was praying on my knees, that same voice spoke in my mind,

8
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:56,000
saying to give 25,000 rupees into the hands of the Father. I didn't feel for a moment that this was just my imagination.

9
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:03,000
I had a very strong conviction. Now, I always carried some cash in my bag. Because of my business, there was always cash.

10
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:09,000
I would keep it in my bag, and since I traveled on a bike, there would always be office cash with me. That was the nature of my business,

11
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:15,000
as I had to pay for vehicle rentals and such, so I always had cash. Right there, I counted the money, took a white paper, wrapped the money in it,

12
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:25,000
and joined the queue. I stood in the queue, and when I reached Father, he placed his hands on my head, and blessed me.

13
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:32,000
Then, I took this bundle, this bundle of 25,000 rupees from my pocket, and placed it in Father's hands.

14
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:36,000
And then I said to Father, "As I was sitting there and praying," he was standing right there.

15
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:44,000
"As I was praying, a voice spoke loudly in my mind telling me to give 25,000 rupees here." Praise the Lord.

16
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:52,000
So Father looked at me, but because of the crowd, he didn't say much then. He just told me that we, must meet later.

17
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:02,000
So the very next day, I came back here. And it was on that day that Father told me, "It was Mother Mary who brought you here."

18
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:11,000
And how that happened is... The day I came was the first anniversary of the installation of Mother Mary's grotto here.

19
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:19,000
Mother was installed in 2002. So, on the day I came, there was a rally held for the anniversary.

20
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:27,000
When the people were returning, the sponsor who had promised to pay for the vehicles hadn't shown up.

21
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:34,000
Their funds weren't ready. From 10 AM that morning, Father gathered a few people, and they were praying to Mother Mary.

22
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:40,000
They were short of exactly 25,000 rupees. They needed to pay 25,000 rupees. For that, from 10 AM they had been praying here.

23
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:46,000
They started praying at 10 AM, and the money had to be paid by 2 PM. And there I was at 1 PM,

24
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:54,000
praying over there, and Mother Mary spoke to me there, telling me to bring it and give it here. That was the day,

25
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:58,000
I truly understood that the presence of Mother Mary is absolutely real here. You shouldn't doubt it even for a single percent. Praise the Lord.
